<title>UK: Johnson Matthey up as Kleinwort positive.</title>
<headline>Johnson Matthey up as Kleinwort positive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Johnson Matthey Plc rose on Monday as the precious metals group was named as one of the preferred stocks for 1997 by strategists at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 6p at 559 by 1114 GMT in modest volume of 399,410 shares.</p>
<p>Strategists at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
